'''Tanglevine Base''' was a hidden base located on [[Tenoo]] during the [[High Republic Era]]. It was once used as a base of operation by [[Kaliah Kublop]] and [[Staas Ragnabi]].<ref name="Lost Treasure of Tenoo" /> When it was rediscovered by Kai Brightstar and Djovi Resmia, Captain Blackbolt intend to use the base to claim the treasure but expelled by Kai and Djovi. During the Battle of Tenoo, the base serves as a staging base for Kai to call for help after the Ganguls captured the temple.

